    {
      "text": "HCV diagnosis and treatment coverage by WHO region and globally: cumulative numbers of people with HCV infection, diagnosed and treated at any time in 2015–2024 (millions), the corresponding percentages diagnosed and treated, and the number diagnosed, alive in 2024 and not yet treated, each with 95% uncertainty intervals.",
